  "origin": "The conclusion gained a wait, and with it an ordering the corpus pinned backwards: `spec_commit` used to be re-stamped before the plan completed, which stamps a settled baseline over a completion the engine can still refuse. The conclusion now asks the wait gate first, completes, and re-baselines after. This walks the unblocked side of that gate — a settled specification, an empty wait, and the completion ahead of the re-stamp. The held side is the engine's to refuse and the simulation's to pin; planning-routes-a-gap-and-pauses walks the gate when it is not empty.",
